</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="bg-outline" aria-hidden="true">Developer</div>
    <div data-i18n-en="LucDoroDesign · Offering" class="kicker">LucDoroDesign · Oferta</div>
    <h1 data-i18n-en="Homegrown tools, <em>I'm building right now</em>">Autorskie narzędzia, <em>które właśnie piszę</em></h1>
    <p data-i18n-en="Desktop apps, LLM panels, portals and visualisations — built because I needed them. Some free and open, some in beta, some planned." class="lead">Desktopowe apki, panele do LLM, portale i wizualizacje — zbudowane bo były potrzebne. Część darmowa i otwarta, część w becie, część planowana.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a data-i18n-en="Download YT Whisper" class="btn btn-wa" href="YTWhisper/">Pobierz YT Whisper</a>
      <a data-i18n-en="Send an email" class="btn btn-olx" href="https://lucdoro.design/#kontakt">Napisz e-mail</a>
      <span data-i18n-en="1 live · 3 coming soon" class="price-pill">1 live · 3 wkrótce</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <section>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 data-i18n-en="4 projects, 4 different goals">4 projekty, 4 różne cele</h2>
      <p data-i18n-en="Each app solves one specific problem. No feature creep, no artificial scaling.">Każda apka rozwiązuje jeden konkretny problem. Bez feature-creepu, bez sztucznego skalowania.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">

      <div class="ex-wrap">
        <a class="ex is-live" href="YTWhisper/">
          <div class="ex-top">
            <span data-i18n-en="Local transcription" class="ex-tag">Transkrypcja lokalna</span>
            <span class="ex-no">01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ex-stage">
            <span data-i18n-en="● Live" class="ex-status live">● Live</span>
            <div class="ex-title">YT <em>Whisper</em></div>
            <div data-i18n-en="Private audio and video transcription from ~1000 platforms. <b>100% offline</b>, no API keys, no cloud. Instagram carousel support with native macOS image OCR." class="ex-desc">Prywatna transkrypcja audio i wideo z ~1000 platform. <b>100% offline</b>, bez API keys, bez chmury. Wsparcie karuzeli IG z natywnym macOS OCR obrazów.</div>
            <div class="ex-meta">
              <span data-i18n-en="Platform <b>macOS 12+</b>">Platforma <b>macOS 12+</b></span>
              <span data-i18n-en="Version <b>1.0.0</b>">Wersja <b>1.0.0</b></span>
              <span data-i18n-en="Engine <b>Whisper + yt-dlp</b>">Silnik <b>Whisper + yt-dlp</b></span>
            </div>
            <span data-i18n-en="Download →" class="ex-cta">Pobierz →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <p data-i18n-en="For journalists, researchers and lawyers — anyone working with sensitive material." class="ex-note">Dla dziennikarzy, badaczy, prawników — każdego kto pracuje z materiałem wrażliwym.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ex-wrap">
        <div class="ex is-soon">
          <div class="ex-top">
            <span data-i18n-en="LLM control panel" class="ex-tag">Panel kontrolny LLM</span>
            <span class="ex-no">02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ex-stage">
            <span class="ex-status soon" data-i18n-en="○ Coming soon">○ Wkrótce</span>
            <div class="ex-title">GPT Mode <em>Panel</em></div>
            <div data-i18n-en="A desktop panel for LLMs — prompt modules, work modes, macros. Three variants: <b>Standard</b>, <b>PRO</b> (freemium), <b>EXPERT</b> (rack carts + ASCII personas)." class="ex-desc">Desktopowy panel do LLM — moduły promptów, tryby pracy, macro. Trzy warianty: <b>Standard</b>, <b>PRO</b> (freemium), <b>EXPERT</b> (rack cart + persona ASCII).</div>
            <div class="ex-meta">
              <span>Platforma <b>macOS</b></span>
              <span><b>3 warianty</b></span>
              <span>Electron</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p data-i18n-en="A panel for daily work with Claude/GPT — presets, reminders, automations." class="ex-note">Panel do codziennej pracy z Claude/GPT — presety, przypomnienia, automatyzacje.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ex-wrap">
        <div class="ex is-soon">
          <div class="ex-top">
            <span data-i18n-en="Unified messaging" class="ex-tag">Unified messaging</span>
            <span class="ex-no">03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ex-stage">
            <span class="ex-status soon" data-i18n-en="○ Coming soon">○ Wkrótce</span>
            <div class="ex-title">Unlimited <em>Portal</em></div>
            <div data-i18n-en="A private Rambox equivalent — one window for <b>WhatsApp, Slack, Discord, Teams, Gmail</b> and 10+ more. Shared sidebar, quick switcher, badge counters." class="ex-desc">Prywatny odpowiednik Ramboxa — jedno okno dla <b>WhatsApp, Slack, Discord, Teams, Gmail</b> i 10+ innych. Wspólny sidebar, quick switcher, badge counters.</div>
            <div class="ex-meta">
              <span>Platforma <b>macOS</b></span>
              <span><b>15+ platform</b></span>
              <span>Electron</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p data-i18n-en="Instead of 15 Chrome windows — one window with a sidebar and badge counters." class="ex-note">Zamiast 15 okien Chrome — jedno okno z sidebarem i badge liczników.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ex-wrap">
        <div class="ex is-soon">
          <div class="ex-top">
            <span data-i18n-en="LLM visualisation" class="ex-tag">Wizualizacja LLM</span>
            <span class="ex-no">04</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ex-stage">
